+/** Small direct-mapped texture cache for boards where TmuTextureCache does not
+  * fit (Tang Mega 138K): `c.texSmallCacheLines` lines of 32 bytes in block
+  * RAM, one per 256-bit DDR3 transfer. Taps are expanded into word reads as in
